{%- comment -%}
  In layout/theme.liquid, find your opening <body> tag and add this class:
  It will look something like:
    <body class="...">
  Add the snippet below INSIDE the class attribute.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} PASTE THIS INSIDE YOUR BODY CLASS ATTRIBUTE: {%- endcomment -%}
{% if collection.handle == 'buy-any-product-99' %}collection-original-price-only{% endif %}


{%- comment -%}
  FULL EXAMPLE of what your body tag might look like after the change:

  <body
    id="shopify-section-body"
    class="template-{{ request.page_type }}
      {% if collection.handle == 'buy-any-product-99' %}collection-original-price-only{% endif %}"
  >
{%- endcomment -%}
